{"id":1117,"date":"2025-01-15T10:13:15","date_gmt":"2025-01-15T09:13:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/?p=1117"},"modified":"2025-03-06T15:09:44","modified_gmt":"2025-03-06T14:09:44","slug":"le-prince-abbe-de-sabourg-invite-dhonneur-a-linvestiture-officielle-du-president-de-la-republique-du-mozambique","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/2025\/01\/15\/le-prince-abbe-de-sabourg-invite-dhonneur-a-linvestiture-officielle-du-president-de-la-republique-du-mozambique\/","title":{"rendered":"LE PRINCE ABB\u00c9 DE SABOURG INVIT\u00c9 D\u2019HONNEUR \u00c0 L\u2019INVESTITURE OFFICIELLE DU PR\u00c9SIDENT DE LA R\u00c9PUBLIQUE DU MOZAMBIQUE"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Le Prince de Sabourg Giovanni Luca a assist\u00e9 le 15 janvier 2025, \u00e0 l\u2019invitation des autorit\u00e9s mozambicaines, \u00e0 l\u2019investiture du Pr\u00e9sident de la R\u00e9publique du Mozambique S.E. Daniel Chapo. Parmi les invit\u00e9s d\u2019honneur figuraient le Pr\u00e9sident de l\u2019Afrique du Sud, S.E. Cyril Ramaphosa, le Pr\u00e9sident de la Guin\u00e9e Bissau, S.E. Umaro Sissoo Embalo, ainsi que d\u2019autres personnalit\u00e9s et institutions politiques et diplomatiques \u00e9trang\u00e8res, notamment : S.E. Fortune Z. Charumbira, Pr\u00e9sident du Parlement de l\u2019Union Africaine Ministre des Affaires Etrang\u00e8res du Portugal, Paulo Rangel (photo \u00e0 gauche du Prince-Abate) Dammu Ravi, Secr\u00e9taire des Relations Economiques du Minist\u00e8re des Affaires Etrang\u00e8res de l\u2019Inde (\u00e0 droite du Prince-Abate).<\/span><\/h6>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<p>La d\u00e9claration du Prince-Abate en faveur du nouveau pr\u00e9sident \u00e0 la fin de la c\u00e9r\u00e9monie \u00e0 Maputo : \u00ab S.E. Daniel Chapo est un r\u00e9formateur qui s\u2019oriente vers une rationalisation bureaucratique coh\u00e9rente pour lutter contre la corruption, donner \u00e0 son peuple de la dignit\u00e9 et un avenir, tant sur le plan humain que technologique \u00bb.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1112 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_f35b0a4b-1024x473.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"473\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_f35b0a4b-1024x473.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_f35b0a4b-300x139.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_f35b0a4b-768x355.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_f35b0a4b-1536x709.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_f35b0a4b-24x11.jpg 24w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_f35b0a4b-36x17.jpg 36w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_f35b0a4b-48x22.jpg 48w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_f35b0a4b.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1111 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_14207c29-1024x473.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"473\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Immagine-WhatsApp-2025-01-22-ore-22.50.05_14207c29-1024x473.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.sabourg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2